    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. it just feels like no matter how much i try to exist or just \"be\" like you said, the weight is always there. it's like i'm just stuck in this loop of struggling and then waking up to do it all over again. i don't even know what i'm fighting for anymore. it's all just so pointless.",
