      "content": "\"let the silence of doing nothing be the only thing you do today\"... that sounds peaceful, i guess. but i feel like \"doing nothing\" just means sitting here thinking about how much i want it all to just end. it's like, instead of feeling peaceful, i just feel like i'm waiting for something to finally stop this.",
